This is primarily an Rstudio issue. I just put in a pull request with a fix. In the mean time you can tell R to open the plot in a new window by putting dev.new <http://dev.new>() above your plot. eg:
dev.new <http://dev.new>()
gl.pcoa.plot(pcoa, gl )

